Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,神奇的口袋中的宝贝 简称神奇宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个世界 非常非常神奇的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.11,0:00:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在海中 森林中 城市里都看得到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,种类可能有一百 两百 三百…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 可能更多也说不定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这名少年 非常喜欢这些神奇宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是真新镇的小智
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从大木博士那里获得了 第一只神奇宝贝 皮卡丘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.67,0:00:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就离开了故乡真新镇 不断的战斗和收服
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.27,0:00:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了成为神奇宝贝训练家 而展开修行旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,跨越重重联盟城市的考验
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.35,0:00:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了获得神奇宝贝联盟比赛的优胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.75,0:01:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了成为最厉害的神奇宝贝大师
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不断的和朋友们相遇与别离
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,小智和他同伴们的旅程 至今仍然继续着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直一直持续着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.91,0:01:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久以前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一座叫做奥多马雷的岛上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.08,0:01:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,住着一个老公公和一个老婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.45,0:01:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.58,0:01:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们两人在海边 救回一对受伤的小兄妹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在老公公跟老婆婆细心的看护下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个人所受的伤慢慢的痊愈了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.07,0:01:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是突然有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶的怪物来侵袭岛屿了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而岛屿很快就要被怪物吞没了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.15,0:02:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.43,0:02:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在老公公和老太太的面前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,小兄妹的样子产生变化
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.44,0:02:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来他们是无限神奇宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯与拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.78,0:02:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两只神奇宝贝 呼唤它们的同伴从空中赶来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.65,0:02:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们带来了赶走黑暗邪恶的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.50,0:03:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一颗叫做心之水滴的宝石
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.58,0:03:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是岛上恢复了和平
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.55,0:03:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.35,0:03:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯与拉帝亚斯经常拜访 这座心之水滴所在的岛屿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后再也没有邪恶的怪物 来袭击这座岛屿了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.14,0:04:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只不过是个传说故事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.51,0:04:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,心之水滴和传说神奇宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯与拉帝欧斯是确实存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.07,0:04:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说故事里还有被隐藏的后续
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,其它的随便怎么样都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要可以找到宝石我就开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.77,0:04:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该可以找到比宝石更棒的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是水都…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.93,0:05:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥多马雷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.31,0:05:19.43,Title,0,0,0,0,,《宠物小精灵剧场版》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.98,0:05:40.96,Title,0,0,0,0,,《水都的守护神 拉帝亚斯和拉帝欧斯》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了要成为神奇宝贝大师 而持续旅行的小智一行人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为要参加水上竞赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.38,0:05:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而来到这里水都 奥多马雷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:05:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.45,0:06:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大家等待已久的 奥多马雷夏日嘉年华
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.85,0:06:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.19,0:06:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,惯例举行的神奇宝贝水上竞赛 马上就要展开了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.63,0:06:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会得到光荣的 奥多马雷杯优胜勋章呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.43,0:06:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.10,0:06:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,1
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.40,0:06:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.49,0:06:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无论火中水中草中森林中 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 土中云中那个女孩的裙子中 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.76,0:06:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 虽然相当相当 相当相当辛苦 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一定收服 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.87,0:06:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 得到神奇宝贝 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.91,0:07:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 向真新镇告别 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我要跟他出去旅行 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 以锻錬的绝招赢下去 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.79,0:07:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 增加同伴前往下一个城市 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.56,0:07:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 梦想终有一天会成真 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 曾经有人这般歌唱过 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.43,0:07:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就像花苞将会绽放般 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 梦想是终会实现的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.64,0:07:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不论什么时候 什么事都会顺利 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这种事没有人敢保证 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.55,0:07:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不论什么时候 都认真的生活 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.65,0:07:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有这样的人们存在 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.46,0:07:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我想成为向往的神奇宝贝大师 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无论如何 一定要成功 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.65,0:08:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我想成为向往的神奇宝贝大师 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.42,0:08:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无论如何 一定要成功 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.50,0:09:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快速穿越狭窄的水道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.97,0:09:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个回到大运河会场的会是谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.97,0:09:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在最前面的是去年的优胜者 罗西选手跟吼吼鲸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来是小霞选手跟太阳珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来优胜者之争
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.21,0:09:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是由这两组人马分高低了 - 加油啊 小霞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,后方居然有一位选手 以猛烈的速度追上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.29,0:09:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是小智选手跟他的小锯鳄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.33,0:09:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,超前了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 小锯鳄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.24,0:09:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得了 小智选手好像搞错了终点位置
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.51,0:09:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,终点前的最后冲刺
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个人还是毫不相让的 互相超前
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.39,0:10:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直就是并排前进
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,1、 2、 3
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.93,0:10:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,终点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.13,0:10:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 两人看起来是同时到达终点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.07,0:10:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从照片 来确认结果
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 犄角在前面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,先到的是太阳珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.15,0:10:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 太阳珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.45,0:10:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.72,0:10:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了庆祝你胜利 我让你搭一搭我的船
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.22,0:10:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,船？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 小霞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.76,0:10:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小智呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.30,0:10:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太在意啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都会有出错的时候嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人向往的奥多马雷小舟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都好想坐一次看看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.97,0:11:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常谢谢你 罗西先生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够让水上竞赛的冠军搭乘
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.71,0:11:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢得的奥多马雷杯优胜勋章
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.88,0:11:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 当然喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这非常的漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西先生 请问一下那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那柱子上的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,右手边的是拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.03,0:11:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而左手边的是拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说中 是它们从灾难中 把这座城市拯救出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说这是奥多马雷的守护神罗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.94,0:12:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说中的神奇宝贝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是拉帝欧斯与拉帝亚斯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.45,0:12:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.65,0:12:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,城里面的人也都深信着 它们还是守护着奥多马雷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.55,0:12:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们真的会在这群人当中吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说故事里不是也有讲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯它们会化成人的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以一定混在人群当中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是真的就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,神奇宝贝跟人类的体温是不一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,宾果
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.73,0:13:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯它们的体温要比人类低
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.51,0:13:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底在搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.29,0:13:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是桑娜和莉安耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.43,0:13:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,名人吗喵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在小偷的世界里 她们可是排名第一的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.53,0:13:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个城里一定藏着什么好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.03,0:13:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们从她们的手中夺走第一的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.10,0:13:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就会 成为真正的第一了喵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.71,0:13:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错不错 这好像很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.18,0:13:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家店的可丽饼是奥多马雷第一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.02,0:13:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要去吃看看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢你招待我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.69,0:13:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那祝你们有愉快的旅程
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.96,0:13:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:13:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我要巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.03,0:13:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要香蕉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.76,0:13:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要卡士达
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.27,0:14:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.79,0:14:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡丘 交到新朋友了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.86,0:14:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.79,0:15:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,化成了女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说这个就是拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还满可爱的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.90,0:15:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那件衣服是什么牌子的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.87,0:15:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那件衣服在哪里买的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.31,0:15:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.25,0:15:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿利多斯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.19,0:15:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡丘
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:16:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,又没有做什么坏事 干嘛要逃走呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是有点事要找你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.76,0:16:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是在确认这孩子的品味而已
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.10,0:16:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,人家可不喜欢这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.43,0:16:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪 我可觉得很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.27,0:16:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的当然不是你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这小鬼竟然对女士说什么你不你的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真失礼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.67,0:16:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得要小心注意你的用词
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.31,0:16:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳精灵 帮我教训教训他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.72,0:16:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然突击我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.29,0:16:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然这样我也要出手了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.15,0:16:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡丘
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.26,0:16:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡丘 十万伏特
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.27,0:16:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,人家特地穿的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:16:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 绝不饶你们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳精灵 追上去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.34,0:17:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿利多斯 你也追
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.82,0:18:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,小智 可丽饼冷掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃完了我们要去大圣堂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.26,0:18:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到了原来的地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么刚刚那些人…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.87,0:18:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你往哪里逃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是…化石？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这是化石翼龙的化石
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边的大理石里可以看到很多的化石
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.87,0:19:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边也有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.23,0:19:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是镰刀盔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.84,0:19:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好壮观哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.01,0:19:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着请参观这一边
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会在这个城市里 跟美丽的大姐姐相遇的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.69,0:20:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇不到的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.69,0:20:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据岛上的传说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.49,0:20:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个圣堂跟太阳之塔 是古代的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.53,0:20:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱着感谢拉帝欧斯跟拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,守护这个城市的心情而建造的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个装置也应该是为了和平而制造的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.81,0:20:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是使用方法还不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这个圣堂进行了好几次装修工程
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.35,0:20:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这个装置本身 从一开始就在这个地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.45,0:20:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且除此之外…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.92,0:20:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是刚刚的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.29,0:20:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 别乱碰！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.03,0:20:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,小智
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,小霞 小刚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先回神奇宝贝中心去 我还有点事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小智…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.84,0:20:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.10,0:21:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.90,0:21:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚为什么没说一声就跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.78,0:22:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,又迷路了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.78,0:22:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这城市简直跟迷宫没什么两样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.39,0:22:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.93,0:23:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡丘！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.14,0:24:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.46,0:25:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有什么在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.64,0:25:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡丘
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.16,0:26:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.26,0:26:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它为什么生气
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.43,0:26:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是从哪里进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.94,0:26:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.10,0:26:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是小偷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.00,0:26:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.24,0:26:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是真新镇的小智
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.94,0:26:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是神奇宝贝训练家
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.51,0:26:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡丘是我的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.95,0:26:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是跟着这个女孩进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.48,0:26:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可疑了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.12,0:26:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.75,0:26:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.19,0:26:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡侬 拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.42,0:26:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子说的都是实话
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.72,0:26:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是爷爷…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.83,0:26:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个导游爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.33,0:26:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.26,0:26:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯 你想跟这孩子玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.30,0:26:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.61,0:27:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.58,0:27:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯…不是神奇宝贝的名字吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.45,0:27:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THERE IS A BRIGHTNESS ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.69,0:27:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ IT'S LIKE THE SUNSHINE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.96,0:27:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THAT COMES DOWN AMONG THE TREES ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.99,0:27:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要紧啦 谢谢你 ∮THAT COMES DOWN AMONG THE TREES ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.96,0:27:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THAT COMES DOWN AMONG THE TREES ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.63,0:27:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ AND KISSES THE GROUND ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.30,0:27:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来拉帝亚斯相当喜欢他 ∮AND KISSES THE GROUND ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.86,0:27:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来拉帝亚斯相当喜欢他 ∮THE CITY IS LIKE A MAZE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.37,0:27:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THE CITY IS LIKE A MAZE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.53,0:27:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ WE ALL NEVER FLY ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.24,0:27:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ WE FEEL THE LONELINESS ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.01,0:27:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THERE IS A WATER ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.31,0:27:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ IT'S SO BEAUTIFUL ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.62,0:27:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THEY KEEP RUNNING TOWARDS A DREAM ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.05,0:27:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ REACHING TO BE FREE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.76,0:27:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ IF YOU ARE AFRAID OF DESPAIR ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.93,0:27:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ PLEASE COME TO MY PRECIOUS WORLD ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.97,0:27:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫做卡侬 刚刚真是不好意思 ∮PLEASE COME TO MY PRECIOUS WORLD ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.17,0:27:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫做卡侬 刚刚真是不好意思 ∮THE SECRET GARDEN'S HERE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.50,0:27:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THE SECRET GARDEN'S HERE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.83,0:28:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这一族自先祖以来的每代子孙 ∮THE SECRET GARDEN'S HERE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.24,0:28:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,都为了到访这个岛屿的 拉帝欧斯跟拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.47,0:28:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,守护着这个秘密花园 ∮WE CAN FLY AWAY ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.41,0:28:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ AND WE CAN TALK HEART TO HEART ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.08,0:28:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们两个是兄妹哦 ∮AND WE CAN TALK HEART TO HEART ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.48,0:28:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ LET'S GET TO PARADISE WITH INVISIBLE WINGS ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.95,0:28:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯是哥哥 ∮LET'S GET TO PARADISE WITH INVISIBLE WINGS ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.85,0:28:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ LET'S GET TO PARADISE WITH INVISIBLE WINGS ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.38,0:28:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而拉帝亚斯是妹妹 ∮LET'S GET TO PARADISE WITH INVISIBLE WINGS ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.72,0:28:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ LET'S GET TO PARADISE WITH INVISIBLE WINGS ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.38,0:28:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ SOMEDAY OUR DREAMS WILL COME TRUE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.52,0:28:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ SO WE CAN FIND THE WAY ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.42,0:28:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ YES WE CAN STAY TOGETHER NOW ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.16,0:28:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ BECAUSE THERE IS HOPE FOR EVERYONE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.13,0:28:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THE SECRET GARDEN'S WAITING FOR YOU ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.03,0:28:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 拉帝亚斯 ∮THE SECRET GARDEN'S WAITING FOR YOU ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.83,0:28:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THE SECRET GARDEN'S WAITING FOR YOU ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.77,0:28:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是的 ∮THE SECRET GARDEN'S WAITING FOR YOU ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.61,0:28:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THE SECRET GARDEN'S WAITING FOR YOU ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.54,0:28:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快还给我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.22,0:28:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THERE ARE SO MANY FLOWERS ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.32,0:28:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ IT'S SO LOVELY ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.99,0:28:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THEY STAY IN YOUR HEART ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.12,0:28:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ YES FOREVER MORE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.13,0:29:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ YOU ARE MY SPECIAL FRIEND ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.70,0:29:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ PLEASE COME TO MY PRECIOUS WORLD ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.44,0:29:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THE SECRET GARDEN'S HERE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.91,0:29:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ WE CAN FLY AWAY ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.01,0:29:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ AND WE CAN TALK HEART TO HEART ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.65,0:29:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ LET'S GET TO PARADISE WITH INVISIBLE WINGS ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.25,0:29:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事 ∮LET'S GET TO PARADISE WITH INVISIBLE WINGS ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.92,0:29:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事 ∮SOMEDAY OUR DREAMS WILL COME TRUE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.76,0:29:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯跟拉帝亚斯它们 ∮SOMEDAY OUR DREAMS WILL COME TRUE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.09,0:29:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看见水中的世界 ∮SOMEDAY OUR DREAMS WILL COME TRUE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.42,0:29:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看见水中的世界 ∮SO WE CAN FIND THE WAY ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.06,0:29:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是梦境转映 ∮SO WE CAN FIND THE WAY ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.09,0:29:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是梦境转映 ∮YES WE CAN STAY TOGETHER NOW ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.59,0:29:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦境转映？ ∮YES WE CAN STAY TOGETHER NOW ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.70,0:29:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ YES WE CAN STAY TOGETHER NOW ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.33,0:29:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ BECAUSE THERE IS HOPE FOR EVERYONE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.90,0:29:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THE SECRET GARDEN'S WAITING FOR YOU ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.34,0:29:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以把自己看到的景像 ∮THE SECRET GARDEN'S WAITING FOR YOU ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.74,0:29:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,传送给别人的一种绝招 ∮THE SECRET GARDEN'S WAITING FOR YOU ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.84,0:29:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ WE CAN FLY AWAY ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.14,0:29:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是它欢迎小智及皮卡丘的证明喔 ∮WE CAN FLY AWAY ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.77,0:29:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是它欢迎小智及皮卡丘的证明喔 ∮AND WE CAN TALK HEART TO HEART ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.04,0:29:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ AND WE CAN TALK HEART TO HEART ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.41,0:29:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ LET'S GET TO PARADISE WITH INVISIBLE WINGS ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.62,0:29:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ SOMEDAY OUR DREAMS WILL COME TRUE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.05,0:29:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ SO WE CAN FIND THE WAY ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.02,0:30:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ YES WE CAN STAY TOGETHER NOW ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.32,0:30:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯 拉帝亚斯 ∮YES WE CAN STAY TOGETHER NOW ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.99,0:30:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ BECAUSE THERE IS HOPE FOR EVERYONE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.12,0:30:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真是太有趣了 ∮BECAUSE THERE IS HOPE FOR EVERYONE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.79,0:30:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ BECAUSE THERE IS HOPE FOR EVERYONE ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.63,0:30:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ THE SECRET GARDEN'S WAITING FOR YOU ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.87,0:30:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们带来了赶走黑暗邪恶的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.05,0:30:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一颗叫做心之水滴的宝石
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.35,0:30:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是岛上恢复了和平
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.05,0:30:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此之后拉帝欧斯与拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.96,0:30:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,经常拜访这个心之水滴所在的岛屿
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.30,0:30:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后再也没有邪恶怪物 来袭击这个岛屿了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.87,0:30:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是这只拉帝欧斯的祖先 守护了这座岛屿
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.91,0:30:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样没错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.54,0:30:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是圣堂的那幅图吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.28,0:30:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这幅图记载着心之水滴所拥有的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.01,0:31:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的使用方法
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.45,0:31:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的使用方法？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.60,0:31:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是心之水滴
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.40,0:31:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的祖先制造出了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.57,0:31:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用拉帝欧斯它们来引出心之水滴 所隐藏的神秘力量的装置
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.84,0:31:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来守护这座岛屿
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.01,0:31:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要保证不会告诉任何人 今天所看到的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.81,0:31:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.58,0:31:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.29,0:31:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.77,0:31:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,它说它还想再玩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.24,0:31:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我也差不多应该要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.14,0:32:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次我再来找你一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.55,0:32:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.18,0:32:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.78,0:32:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.05,0:32:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.08,0:32:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是我工作的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.48,0:32:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小舟的修理工厂
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.05,0:32:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不忙的时候 我还兼差当导游呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.89,0:32:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡侬
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.02,0:32:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,送小智回神奇宝贝中心去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.86,0:32:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.71,0:33:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡侬 中午被追的是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.81,0:33:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.18,0:33:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.08,0:33:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来那是拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.11,0:33:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在追拉帝亚斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.62,0:33:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是两个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.55,0:33:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯它…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.21,0:33:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那矫健的身手连长尾怪手看了 也会脸色发青喵
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.68,0:33:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不愧是第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.58,0:33:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不会输给她们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.18,0:33:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的目标是第一
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.02,0:33:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.82,0:33:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.11,0:34:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好讨厌的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.73,0:34:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你是从哪里进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.25,0:34:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳精灵 非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.07,0:35:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方还不赖嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.71,0:35:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,干脆把我的别墅设在这里好了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.75,0:35:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来现在住在这里的人还不想搬走呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.62,0:35:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.42,0:35:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把它们养起来当我们的宠物好了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.53,0:35:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.60,0:35:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来它们不只拥有变身的能力而已
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.17,0:35:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话要找到它们可就有点难了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.85,0:36:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.58,0:36:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳精灵 高速星星
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.12,0:36:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错哦 太阳精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.72,0:36:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.76,0:36:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿利多斯 黑夜诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.43,0:36:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别让我…多费工夫呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.89,0:36:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳精灵 幻象光
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.23,0:36:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳精灵 冲击
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.14,0:36:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳精灵 幻象术
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.04,0:36:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿利多斯 吐丝
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.29,0:37:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,休想逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.06,0:37:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你往哪儿跑
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.58,0:37:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它逃走了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.05,0:37:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到一只就够了 而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.09,0:37:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡得还真紧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.39,0:37:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心一点 不要弄坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.49,0:37:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.20,0:38:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.44,0:38:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,心之水滴
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.38,0:38:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个比以前看到的任何宝石 都要漂亮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.25,0:38:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了 找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.51,0:38:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么 宝石就在这边不是
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.48,0:38:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是跟你说过 传说故事是还有后续的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.16,0:38:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爷爷用心之水滴的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.62,0:38:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,来永远守护这个岛屿
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.70,0:38:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.83,0:38:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用心之水滴的力量的装置
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.90,0:38:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是人类制造出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.80,0:38:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这个应该就是 记载着使用方法的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.07,0:38:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写些什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.47,0:38:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,心怀不轨者在使用心之水滴时
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.64,0:38:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,心灵将会污浊而失去水滴
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.08,0:38:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,连同这座岛屿一起失去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.98,0:38:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.22,0:38:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一定只是随便唬人的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.89,0:38:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,借我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.89,0:38:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.86,0:38:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谜底都解开了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.49,0:38:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着让我来试试看它的力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.38,0:39:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,心之水滴被…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.18,0:39:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会有这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.12,0:39:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是小智说的那些人做的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.57,0:40:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是可以保护这座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.91,0:40:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不受任何敌人的攻击的装置哟
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.45,0:40:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是…你们在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.05,0:40:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了一个多管闲事的人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.89,0:40:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要来清扫一下罗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.29,0:40:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳精灵 幻象术
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.10,0:40:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安罗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.20,0:40:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 让我来试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.42,0:41:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 皮卡丘
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.42,0:41:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡侬！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.06,0:41:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.63,0:41:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.30,0:41:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯 这两个人是我的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.97,0:41:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以放心 不用害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.36,0:42:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.60,0:42:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒一醒 拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.83,0:42:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.17,0:42:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.02,0:42:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个就是控制器
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.52,0:42:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐起来很不舒服的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.76,0:42:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.17,0:43:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.54,0:43:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是…大圣堂里面！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.91,0:43:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.24,0:43:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是梦境转映
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.71,0:43:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦境转映？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.28,0:43:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在所看到的 跟拉帝欧斯所看到的是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.68,0:43:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡侬！本葛雷先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.79,0:43:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,心之水滴被…！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.17,0:43:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 表演时间开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.17,0:43:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们见识一下心之水滴的力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.88,0:43:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快住手 这不是你们能够控制的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.97,0:44:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,化石翼龙
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.87,0:44:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,镰刀盔
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.97,0:44:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然把化石神奇宝贝…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.97,0:44:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会有这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.07,0:44:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个 去把拉帝亚斯给我抓回来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.23,0:44:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯 你不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.86,0:44:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小智 到底是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.83,0:44:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.47,0:44:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不清楚 看来情况不妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.07,0:44:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个城市是属于我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.81,0:44:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.11,0:44:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.12,0:44:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么样先找到运河吧喵
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.02,0:44:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.19,0:45:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.33,0:45:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,被关起来了耶喵
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.50,0:45:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.40,0:45:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.08,0:45:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是用来防止敌人入侵的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.59,0:45:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.33,0:45:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.80,0:45:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.20,0:45:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小智
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.34,0:45:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小刚 小霞 我要去大圣堂一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.21,0:45:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去把大家给救出来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.25,0:46:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小智
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.53,0:46:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯 我们现在要去救你哥哥出来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.13,0:46:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我们带路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.64,0:46:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.87,0:46:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡丘 十万伏特
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.15,0:47:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.42,0:47:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.03,0:47:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃 皮卡丘
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.06,0:47:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.54,0:48:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯 停一下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.21,0:48:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.21,0:48:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好 拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.22,0:48:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 动都不动
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.16,0:48:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.23,0:49:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,小智他把所有的神奇宝贝球 都放在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.23,0:49:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然这样
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.50,0:49:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 叉字蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.10,0:49:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳珊瑚 牛蛙君
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.63,0:49:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.41,0:49:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们三个去帮助小智吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.91,0:49:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 我们马上就会赶过去
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.18,0:49:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.82,0:49:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们也走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.32,0:50:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.64,0:50:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是这个小子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.71,0:50:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,心存不轨者使用了心之水滴
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.21,0:50:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,会造成无可挽回的遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.35,0:50:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别做傻事呀
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.59,0:50:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,威胁对我来讲是没有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.95,0:50:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了这个力量
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.46,0:50:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算要把世界占为己有都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.46,0:50:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉安
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.93,0:50:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我再来试试看这个玩意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.91,0:51:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不让你跑掉
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.79,0:51:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮到了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.43,0:51:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是回敬你的 小子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.09,0:52:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.16,0:52:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯 你不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.64,0:52:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.51,0:52:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么 拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.86,0:52:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太阳精灵 - 皮卡丘 十万伏特
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.94,0:53:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡侬 本葛雷先生
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.54,0:53:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小智
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.01,0:53:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡丘 电击
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.85,0:53:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.03,0:53:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好了 装置开始失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.77,0:53:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉安 莉安！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.28,0:53:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.26,0:53:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯会死掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.89,0:53:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡丘 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.73,0:53:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,十万伏特
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.30,0:54:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.64,0:54:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.89,0:54:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.20,0:54:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.37,0:54:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.68,0:54:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,停了 坏掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.52,0:55:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么样都好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.83,0:55:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.91,0:55:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在搞什么 莉安
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.98,0:55:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点起来罗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.35,0:55:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.42,0:55:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得太过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.05,0:55:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小智
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.06,0:55:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,小智
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.36,0:55:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.96,0:55:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下子你可别怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.73,0:55:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,心之水滴我就没收了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.40,0:55:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们撤退吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.94,0:55:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.67,0:55:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么颜色整个都变了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.87,0:55:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.64,0:55:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个不能碰
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.56,0:56:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,心之水滴…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.00,0:56:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,心怀不轨者在使用心之水滴时
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.97,0:56:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,心灵将会污浊而失去水滴
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.97,0:56:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,连同这座岛一起失去
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.18,0:56:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.11,0:57:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,大海…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.38,0:57:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失了…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.74,0:57:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.58,0:57:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市要被淹没了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.03,0:58:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.33,0:58:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.62,1:00:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚那个是…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.16,1:00:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看 是海
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.47,1:00:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么了 这个城市
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.38,1:00:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次又是什么啦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.38,1:00:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.42,1:00:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊喵
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.05,1:00:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好讨厌的感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.95,1:01:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你把事情搞得那么复杂
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.25,1:01:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝石就是宝石 只要漂亮就好了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.99,1:01:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有看到这装置的力量吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.09,1:01:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是是 我一定会好好的把它收起来的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.16,1:01:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正姐姐你就是不懂 这些东西的价值在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.06,1:01:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,从以前开始就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.50,1:01:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫从以前开始就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.17,1:01:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是没有经过我的同意
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.40,1:01:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把我的臭臭花进化成霸王花
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.37,1:01:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的是美丽花
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.61,1:01:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 那都几百年前的事了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.97,1:01:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,幼稚园的事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.71,1:01:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可别说现在已经忘记了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.51,1:01:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的 记忆力好的女人最差劲了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.32,1:01:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.75,1:01:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事那么大声干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.59,1:01:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是姐姐你先大声的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.29,1:01:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 你的发型太碍眼了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.46,1:01:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很吵耶
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.20,1:01:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.20,1:01:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉帝亚斯 - 拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.73,1:01:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉帝亚斯 - 拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.04,1:01:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.94,1:01:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.94,1:02:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉帝亚斯 - 拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.35,1:02:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.23,1:02:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.93,1:02:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作一点 拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.90,1:02:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.40,1:02:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.51,1:02:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝亚斯 拉帝欧斯在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.08,1:02:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 那道光是…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.56,1:02:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯它 牺牲了生命拯救这座城市
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.20,1:02:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.31,1:03:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.25,1:03:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是梦境转映
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.15,1:03:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一定是你让我们看到的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.42,1:03:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.50,1:03:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色的水之星 好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.93,1:04:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.31,1:04:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这光芒真的好温暖
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.54,1:04:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.31,1:04:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是世界上最美丽的光芒
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.11,1:04:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你永远守护这个城市
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.22,1:04:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉帝欧斯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.12,1:05:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,本葛雷先生
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.43,1:05:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你这几天的照顾
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.56,1:05:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经要回去了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.06,1:05:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.86,1:05:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.17,1:05:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡侬 小智他们好像要出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.67,1:05:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡侬
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.77,1:05:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在吗 刚刚还在的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.94,1:05:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 那麻烦你帮我们跟她说一声
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.41,1:06:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 路上小心
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.48,1:06:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.73,1:06:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡侬？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.50,1:06:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 麻烦你停一下
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.98,1:06:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡侬
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.80,1:07:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚那个是卡侬 还是拉帝亚斯？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.54,1:07:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 不过…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.61,1:07:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.53,1:07:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如同大海要有风 早晨要有太阳 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.71,1:07:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那样的重要般 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.91,1:07:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你身边一定也有 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.52,1:07:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 觉得你很重要的人 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.52,1:07:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如同森林要有水 夜晚要有光 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.73,1:07:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那样的重要般 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.93,1:08:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一定有人在为你可以好好的生活 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.57,1:08:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 而默默祈祷 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.24,1:08:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不管是路程有多远 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.45,1:08:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 总有一天会抵达终点 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.75,1:08:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如果停下步伐不继续前进 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.56,1:08:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 梦想将慢慢消失 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.56,1:08:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不要害怕 不要舍弃勇气 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.00,1:08:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你并不是孤孤单单一个人 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.27,1:08:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 总有一天 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.58,1:08:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 二人一起追逐过的星星 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.71,1:08:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 即使是现在也将闪耀 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.88,1:08:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 即使憎恨 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.12,1:09:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 暗潮汹涌的未来 要将我们吞没 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.19,1:09:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 互相信任 互相容忍的心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.50,1:09:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 也请永远不要失去 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.14,1:09:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如同大海要有风 早晨要有太阳 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.24,1:09:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那样的重要般 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.42,1:10:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你身边一定也有 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.06,1:10:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 觉得你很重要的人 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.79,1:10:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不管是多长多远的坡道 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.90,1:10:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 总有一天能爬越到终点 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.40,1:10:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如果停下步伐不继续前进 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.01,1:10:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 梦想将慢慢消失 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.15,1:10:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不要害怕 不要舍弃勇气 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.32,1:10:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你并不是孤孤单单一个人 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.53,1:10:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 总有一天 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.93,1:10:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 二人一起跨越过的彩虹 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.13,1:10:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 即使现在也将闪耀 ∮
